{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>Their posts, four.</b> In the span of the gate of the courtyard there are only three posts, but across the entire fifty cubits on the east side there are eleven posts. Remove one of them — at the south-east corner or at the north-east corner, whichever you wish — and ten spaces and ten posts remain for the fifty cubits: a space and a post for every five cubits. Take from them three spaces and three posts for the north shoulder, and likewise for the south shoulder, and four spaces and four posts remain for you for the twenty cubits of the gate of the courtyard. By this method you must set up all the posts of the courtyard hangings, and likewise for the north side — examine carefully and you will find it." "<b>[And its posts.</b> Defective of yud.]"], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:00:44.167619728Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}